/-!
# KFM Log18a: the logarithmic factor of the Kronecker products (`Log18Need`)

With `P = p = 6b` and `q = ⌊log₂ P⌋`: `kb < 2^{q+3}`, so `m + 1 < 2^{q+ℓ+5}` and
`L₁ = zsz(m+1) + 2 ≤ ℓ + q + 7 ≤ 3P`; then `L₁⁴ < 2^{4q+11}` and `L₂ ≤ 4q + 12`. Since
`q ≤ log₂ P` and `q ≤ ln P / ln 2 < 2 ln P`, `L₁ L₂ ≤ 84 (ℓ + log₂ P + 1)(ln P + 1)`.
Main result: **`log18Need : KFV.Log18Need`** (`c = 84`, no extra threshold).
-/

